            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a sintaxe para chamar a função <code>.filter()</code> no array <code>loot</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Torch&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Token&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Trap&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" T = loot.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(T);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>loot.filter</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione a declaração de função inline e o parâmetro apropriado para preencher o array <code>bossDamage</code> usando <code>.filter()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"100\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossDamage = enemyDamage.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total &gt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>function(total)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Examine os parâmetros e complete a sintaxe de forma que <code>first3</code> armazene os três primeiros inimigos de <code>spawnQueue</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"132\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spawnQueue = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Orc&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first3 = spawnQueue.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(first3);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
