            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que passamos uma função como parâmetro dentro de <code>.reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Para dizer à função <code>.reduce()</code> como combinar os valores do jogo em um único resultado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para informar à função <code>.reduce()</code> qual array modificar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Para dizer à função <code>.reduce()</code> quais elementos manter ou remover</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Para dizer à função <code>.reduce()</code> como combinar os valores do jogo em um único resultado.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a sintaxe para chamar a função <code>.reduce()</code> no array <code>coinPickups</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"78\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coinPickups = [\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalCoins = coinPickups.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalCoins);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>coinPickups.reduce</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
