            "id": 148390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é a quantidade mínima de parâmetros que precisamos para fazer <code>.reduce()</code> funcionar?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">3</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher 2.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique uma função de seta que receba dois parâmetros ( <code>prev</code> e <code>curr</code> ) e retorne a soma deles.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"comboHits\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" comboHits = [\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"125\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"465\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" comboTotal = comboHits.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prev + curr);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(comboTotal);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>(</code> seguido de <code>prev</code> e depois <code>,</code>, <code>curr</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>prev + curr</code>.</p></body></html>"
